# NIRUPI runtime window rules. Read by dwm when a window is managed; changes
# apply to new windows immediately, no rebuild needed.
#
# Format (pipe separated):
#   class|instance|title|tag|float|terminal|noswallow|fullscreen|monitor
#
# Empty or * matches anything. tag is 1-9 (0 keeps the current tag).
# monitor is -1 (default) or a monitor number (0, 1, ...).
#
# Examples:
# Signal|||9|0|0|0|0|-1
# mpv|||0|1|0|0|0|-1
# Gimp||| 5|1|0|0|0|-1
# Picture-in-Picture|||0|1|0|0|0|-1
